OL,4,CRussell Brand's wife says she'll       
OL,5,Chonour prison rules after message row  
OL,6,GThe wife of disgraced comedian Russell 
OL,7,GBrand says she will "honour" the rules 
OL,8,Gof his prison, a week after she read a 
OL,9,Gmessage from her husband proclaiming   
OL,10,Ghis innocence.                         
OL,12,FLaura Brand, 39, drew criticism from   
OL,13,Fministers after reading out the        
OL,14,Fmessage from inside HMP Littlehey last 
OL,15,Fweek, prompting the government to seek 
OL,16,Fto have the episode removed from       
OL,17,Fsocial media platforms.                
